* C156: RETAPER BOTH FILES TOGETHER - one equal ratio of 2.29 across
* all six stages, total widths P+N split ~1.4:1 P over N (first-order,
* stated): XB1 0.85 (unchanged) -> XB2 1.95 (1.14/0.81) -> XM7/8 4.47
* (2.61/1.86) -> XM9/10 10.25 (5.98/4.27) -> [isobuf include] XISO1
* 23.5 (13.71/9.79) -> XISO2 53.87 (31.42/22.45). C155's scope error:
* XM9/10 (48u) drove a 4.83u gate (0.10) and XISO1 drove 43.2u (8.94);
* both out of band. Base: C148-SOURCE (NAND, cml, sense amp, CMFB
* untouched). Prediction (PE): ~24 pc less delay, spread ~520 ps,
* intersection about +160 ps at 800 ps/bit.
