EU1 u1 0 VALUE {floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/128) >= 1}
EUB1 ubar1 0 VALUE {1-(floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/128) >= 1)}
EU2 u2 0 VALUE {floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/128) >= 2}
EUB2 ubar2 0 VALUE {1-(floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/128) >= 2)}
EU3 u3 0 VALUE {floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/128) >= 3}
EUB3 ubar3 0 VALUE {1-(floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/128) >= 3)}
EU4 u4 0 VALUE {floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/128) >= 4}
EUB4 ubar4 0 VALUE {1-(floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/128) >= 4)}
EU5 u5 0 VALUE {floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/128) >= 5}
EUB5 ubar5 0 VALUE {1-(floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/128) >= 5)}
EU6 u6 0 VALUE {floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/128) >= 6}
EUB6 ubar6 0 VALUE {1-(floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/128) >= 6)}
EU7 u7 0 VALUE {floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/128) >= 7}
EUB7 ubar7 0 VALUE {1-(floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/128) >= 7)}
EB0 b0 0 VALUE {floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/1)-2*floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/2)}
EBB0 bbar0 0 VALUE {1-(floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/1)-2*floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/2))}
EB1 b1 0 VALUE {floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/2)-2*floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/4)}
EBB1 bbar1 0 VALUE {1-(floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/2)-2*floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/4))}
EB2 b2 0 VALUE {floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/4)-2*floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/8)}
EBB2 bbar2 0 VALUE {1-(floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/4)-2*floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/8))}
EB3 b3 0 VALUE {floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/8)-2*floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/16)}
EBB3 bbar3 0 VALUE {1-(floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/8)-2*floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/16))}
EB4 b4 0 VALUE {floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/16)-2*floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/32)}
EBB4 bbar4 0 VALUE {1-(floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/16)-2*floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/32))}
EB5 b5 0 VALUE {floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/32)-2*floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/64)}
EBB5 bbar5 0 VALUE {1-(floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/32)-2*floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/64))}
EB6 b6 0 VALUE {floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/64)-2*floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/128)}
EBB6 bbar6 0 VALUE {1-(floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/64)-2*floor((v(code)*100+0.5)/128))}
XTAP1 VSS sub! ptap1 R={ 1.0 / ( 1.0 / ( 9.8e-10 / ( 2.0u * 2.0u ) ) + 1.0 / ( 9.8e-4 / ( 2.0 * ( 2.0u + 2.0u ) ) ) )} w=2.0u l=2.0u
.ends

* C42-V3 interface block: matched NPN emitter-follower level shift (PDK-only).
* Physical CM conditioning between the published preamp outputs
* (NOISE_AMP_P/N, CM ~2.02-2.19 V) and the comparator input stage
* (design CM ~1.44 V). PROVISIONAL: external VCB = VCC_HBT - V_B is
* expected positive from the stated rails (2.5 V - 2.035..2.168 V);
* actual device region remains UNKNOWN pending waveform review.
* rppd res_typ: rsh = 260 ohm/sq,
* dw = 0.006u -> XRLS w=1.0u l=3.85u gives about one source-derived
* 1 kohm (3.85/1.006 * 260 = 995 ohm). Retained amplifier HBT evidence:
* VBE = 0.886-0.893 V at 1.35-1.53 mA (NOT 0.75 V) -> expected LS CM
* about 1.14-1.28 V (amp CM 2.035-2.168 - VBE 0.886-0.893).
* AC loading/gain/region and final CM are UNKNOWN pending runtime;
* npn13G2 Nx=1 m=1 (IC target ~1.1-1.3 mA < 3.5 mA max, Nx <= 10,
* selft=1). No beta, capacitance, gain-fraction, loading-percent or
* reliability claims are made (unverified).
.subckt ls_pbit LS_P LS_N VCC_HBT VSS NOISE_AMP_P NOISE_AMP_N
XLS_P VCC_HBT NOISE_AMP_P LS_P sub! npn13G2 Nx=1 mm_ok=1
XLS_N VCC_HBT NOISE_AMP_N LS_N sub! npn13G2 Nx=1 mm_ok=1
XRLS_P LS_P VSS sub! rppd w=1.0u l=3.85u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRLS_N LS_N VSS sub! rppd w=1.0u l=3.85u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
.ends

.end